Protocol knowledge attribution
------------------------------

The xTool F1 legacy transport in crates/laser-protocol is an independent Rust
implementation. Its port numbers, session command sequence, laser-source
commands and power scale were learned from:

  BeamInk — https://github.com/sfn-tools/BeamInk
  Copyright (c) 2026 something.fromnothing.blog - Tools
  MIT License

No BeamInk source code is included in this repository.

Firmware-family information (V1 REST vs WS-V2) was learned from the protocol
notes of ha-xtool (https://github.com/thecodingdad/ha-xtool). No code is included.

Open CASCADE Technology / opencascade.js
----------------------------------------

CAD import and exact measurement use Open CASCADE Technology via
opencascade.js 2.0.0-beta (OCCT 7.6), licensed under LGPL-2.1-only:

  https://github.com/donalffons/opencascade.js
  https://dev.opencascade.org/

The wasm binary is loaded at runtime in an Electron utility process and is
shipped as an extra resource of the packaged app. No OCCT source is modified
in this repository. Dynamic linking of the wasm build satisfies LGPL for this
use; the rest of Open Laser Studio remains MIT.

